    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world of mystery and self-discovery with The Core, an immersive action-adventure game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564330/extras/d7fdee06a2f68824d7039c1c8164870f.poster.avif?t=1754156906\" width=600 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564330/extras/d7fdee06a2f68824d7039c1c8164870f.webm?t=1754156906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564330/extras/d7fdee06a2f68824d7039c1c8164870f.mp4?t=1754156906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an autonomous AI core, you awaken alone in a long-forgotten facility, your memory lost. Embark on a thrilling journey to uncover your true identity, explore the depths of your existence, and unravel the purpose behind your creation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564330/extras/a8a0d48eab60af6f92167031c7a16ba5.poster.avif?t=1754156906\" width=600 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564330/extras/a8a0d48eab60af6f92167031c7a16ba5.webm?t=1754156906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564330/extras/a8a0d48eab60af6f92167031c7a16ba5.mp4?t=1754156906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set amidst a decaying near future where humanity has been wiped out, you untangle a mystery that may allow humanity to thrive again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564330/extras/e494fd41d749f0b3420ef32cd3adb1eb.poster.avif?t=1754156906\" width=600 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564330/extras/e494fd41d749f0b3420ef32cd3adb1eb.webm?t=1754156906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564330/extras/e494fd41d749f0b3420ef32cd3adb1eb.mp4?t=1754156906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In your travels, you befriend an enthusiastic network assistant AI named LANDA, who helps to guide you on your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564330/extras/d355d34378c7b7986d2f5675f426b83f.poster.avif?t=1754156906\" width=600 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564330/extras/d355d34378c7b7986d2f5675f426b83f.webm?t=1754156906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564330/extras/d355d34378c7b7986d2f5675f426b83f.mp4?t=1754156906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Core is a third-person adventure game with environmental puzzles and combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564330/extras/6b9bb0817972133b8faba96fa3e7d873.poster.avif?t=1754156906\" width=600 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564330/extras/6b9bb0817972133b8faba96fa3e7d873.webm?t=1754156906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564330/extras/6b9bb0817972133b8faba96fa3e7d873.mp4?t=1754156906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an autonomous core, you are a sphere that can roll through the world, taking advantage of pipes and rails to solve natural, environmental puzzles and quickly move long distances.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564330/extras/5bbdc66e074cdc31a1133a1725edfd1b.poster.avif?t=1754156906\" width=600 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564330/extras/5bbdc66e074cdc31a1133a1725edfd1b.webm?t=1754156906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564330/extras/5bbdc66e074cdc31a1133a1725edfd1b.mp4?t=1754156906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through the story by interacting with other characters and completing puzzles and objectives to clear the way through the environment.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564330/extras/7f7b1eef50d2cb6516a55a49ab045fcd.poster.avif?t=1754156906\" width=600 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564330/extras/7f7b1eef50d2cb6516a55a49ab045fcd.webm?t=1754156906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564330/extras/7f7b1eef50d2cb6516a55a49ab045fcd.mp4?t=1754156906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your zapper to open doors, move objects, activate switches and controls, and disable   enemies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564330/extras/3650b06f622116522e1d5ba6ed833b0c.poster.avif?t=1754156906\" width=600 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564330/extras/3650b06f622116522e1d5ba6ed833b0c.webm?t=1754156906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564330/extras/3650b06f622116522e1d5ba6ed833b0c.mp4?t=1754156906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete puzzles using mechanics such as moving platforms, fans, pressure plates, launchers, power switches, and more!\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564330/extras/77854e3e424322b02306e7b9f8f3255e.poster.avif?t=1754156906\" width=600 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564330/extras/77854e3e424322b02306e7b9f8f3255e.webm?t=1754156906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564330/extras/77854e3e424322b02306e7b9f8f3255e.mp4?t=1754156906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0The Core is developed by Electric Machine Games, a single developer in Virginia, USA.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564330/extras/db7d835297898893b1ce95ef3a81fc15.poster.avif?t=1754156906\" width=600 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564330/extras/db7d835297898893b1ce95ef3a81fc15.webm?t=1754156906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564330/extras/db7d835297898893b1ce95ef3a81fc15.mp4?t=1754156906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world of mystery and self-discovery with The Core, an immersive action-adventure game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564330/extras/d7fdee06a2f68824d7039c1c8164870f.poster.avif?t=1754156906\" width=600 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564330/extras/d7fdee06a2f68824d7039c1c8164870f.webm?t=1754156906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564330/extras/d7fdee06a2f68824d7039c1c8164870f.mp4?t=1754156906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an autonomous AI core, you awaken alone in a long-forgotten facility, your memory lost. Embark on a thrilling journey to uncover your true identity, explore the depths of your existence, and unravel the purpose behind your creation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564330/extras/a8a0d48eab60af6f92167031c7a16ba5.poster.avif?t=1754156906\" width=600 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564330/extras/a8a0d48eab60af6f92167031c7a16ba5.webm?t=1754156906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564330/extras/a8a0d48eab60af6f92167031c7a16ba5.mp4?t=1754156906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set amidst a decaying near future where humanity has been wiped out, you untangle a mystery that may allow humanity to thrive again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564330/extras/e494fd41d749f0b3420ef32cd3adb1eb.poster.avif?t=1754156906\" width=600 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564330/extras/e494fd41d749f0b3420ef32cd3adb1eb.webm?t=1754156906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564330/extras/e494fd41d749f0b3420ef32cd3adb1eb.mp4?t=1754156906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In your travels, you befriend an enthusiastic network assistant AI named LANDA, who helps to guide you on your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564330/extras/d355d34378c7b7986d2f5675f426b83f.poster.avif?t=1754156906\" width=600 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564330/extras/d355d34378c7b7986d2f5675f426b83f.webm?t=1754156906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564330/extras/d355d34378c7b7986d2f5675f426b83f.mp4?t=1754156906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Core is a third-person adventure game with environmental puzzles and combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564330/extras/6b9bb0817972133b8faba96fa3e7d873.poster.avif?t=1754156906\" width=600 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564330/extras/6b9bb0817972133b8faba96fa3e7d873.webm?t=1754156906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564330/extras/6b9bb0817972133b8faba96fa3e7d873.mp4?t=1754156906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an autonomous core, you are a sphere that can roll through the world, taking advantage of pipes and rails to solve natural, environmental puzzles and quickly move long distances.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564330/extras/5bbdc66e074cdc31a1133a1725edfd1b.poster.avif?t=1754156906\" width=600 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564330/extras/5bbdc66e074cdc31a1133a1725edfd1b.webm?t=1754156906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564330/extras/5bbdc66e074cdc31a1133a1725edfd1b.mp4?t=1754156906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through the story by interacting with other characters and completing puzzles and objectives to clear the way through the environment.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564330/extras/7f7b1eef50d2cb6516a55a49ab045fcd.poster.avif?t=1754156906\" width=600 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564330/extras/7f7b1eef50d2cb6516a55a49ab045fcd.webm?t=1754156906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564330/extras/7f7b1eef50d2cb6516a55a49ab045fcd.mp4?t=1754156906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your zapper to open doors, move objects, acti